# GlobalTrotters — Complete Implementation Plan

## 1. Executive Summary

**GlobalTrotters** is an enterprise-grade, multi-city travel planning platform that empowers users to create, customize, share, and budget complex itineraries. This plan covers the full architecture, database design, API surface, frontend screens, deployment strategy, and a phased delivery roadmap.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This is a production-ready plan. Each phase is self-contained and testable. Approval is required before execution begins.

