### Architecture Decisions & Rationale

| Decision | Rationale |
|----------|-----------|
| **React + TypeScript** | Type safety, superior DX, massive ecosystem, component reusability |
| **Redux Toolkit + RTK Query** | Standardized state management with built-in caching, optimistic updates, and auto-refetch |
| **Node.js + Express** | Lightweight, non-blocking I/O, same language as frontend (TypeScript end-to-end) |
| **Supabase (PostgreSQL)** | Managed Postgres with built-in auth, RLS, real-time subscriptions, and auto-generated REST — eliminates boilerplate |
| **Redis** | Sub-millisecond reads for city/activity search caching, rate-limiting, and session store |
| **Vercel** | Zero-config React deployment, automatic SSL, edge CDN, Git-based CI/CD |
| **Railway** | Simple Node.js hosting with env vars, auto-scaling, Redis plugin, generous free tier |
| **Material-UI** | Comprehensive, accessible, well-documented component library with theming support |

