|---------|----------|
| **Authentication** | Supabase Auth (bcrypt-hashed, JWTs, refresh tokens) |
| **Authorization** | Middleware checks `user.id` owns the resource; admin flag for admin routes |
| **Input Validation** | Zod schemas on every request body/params |
| **SQL Injection** | Prisma ORM with parameterized queries (no raw SQL) |
| **XSS** | React auto-escapes; sanitize user-generated HTML with DOMPurify |
| **CSRF** | SameSite cookies; token-based auth (not cookie-based sessions) |
| **Rate Limiting** | Redis-backed rate limiter on auth + search endpoints |
| **CORS** | Whitelist only `vercel-domain.app` and `localhost` |
| **Helmet.js** | Security headers (X-Frame-Options, CSP, HSTS) |
| **Dependency Audit** | `npm audit` in CI pipeline |

