## 9. Caching Strategy

| Data | TTL | Strategy |
|------|-----|----------|
| City search results | 24 hours | Redis key: `city:search:{query}` |
| Popular cities | 6 hours | Redis key: `cities:popular` |
| Activity search | 1 hour | Redis key: `activity:search:{hash}` |
| Trip budget | 5 minutes | Redis key: `trip:{id}:budget` — invalidated on stop/activity change |
| Public trip data | 10 minutes | Redis key: `public:trip:{token}` |

