## 11. CI/CD Pipeline

```mermaid
graph LR
    A[Push to GitHub] --> B[GitHub Actions CI]
    B --> C{Lint & Type Check}
    C -->|Pass| D[Run Unit Tests]
    C -->|Fail| X[❌ Block Merge]
    D -->|Pass| E[Run Integration Tests]
    D -->|Fail| X
    E -->|Pass| F[Build Client + Server]
    E -->|Fail| X
    F -->|Pass| G{Branch?}
    G -->|main| H[Deploy to Production]
    G -->|develop| I[Deploy to Staging]
    H --> J[Vercel: Client]
    H --> K[Railway: Server]
    I --> L[Vercel Preview]
    I --> M[Railway Staging]
```

### CI Steps (`ci.yml`)
1. **Checkout** code
2. **Install** dependencies (`npm ci`)
3. **Lint** (`eslint`) + **Type check** (`tsc --noEmit`)
4. **Unit tests** (`jest --coverage`)
5. **Integration tests** (spin up test DB via Docker)
6. **Build** client (`vite build`) and server (`tsc`)
7. **Upload** coverage to Codecov

### Deploy Steps (`deploy.yml`)
1. Triggered on merge to `main`
2. Deploy `client/` to **Vercel** via Vercel CLI
3. Deploy `server/` to **Railway** via Railway CLI
4. Run **Prisma migrations** against production Supabase
5. Invalidate CDN cache

